### ============================================================
### UNIFIED CHART MARKET REST API TEST SUITE
### Server Base URL: http://localhost:8000
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Health Check & Server Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. List Supported Platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/platforms
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Lowest Price Across All Platforms (Global Floor Price)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lowest
Accept: application/json

### 4. Get Lowest Price for Specific Item Across Platforms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/lowest?item_name=PoE%201%20Divine%20Orb
Accept: application/json

### 5. Get Lowest Price on G2G
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/g2g/lowest
Accept: application/json

### 6. Get Lowest Price on Eldorado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eldorado/lowest
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Items Configured for G2G
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/g2g/items
Accept: application/json

### 8. Get Snapshot Price Data (G2G)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/g2g/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 9. Get Snapshot Price Data (Eldorado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eldorado/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 10. Get Snapshot Price Data (Qiandao)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/qiandao/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 11. Get Snapshot Price Data (DD373)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dd373/snapshot
Accept: application/json

### 12. Get Price History for Specific Item
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/g2g/history?item_name=PoE%201%20Divine%20Orb
Accept: application/json

### 13. Trigger On-Demand Scrape for G2G
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/g2g/scrape
Accept: application/json

### 14. Trigger On-Demand Scrape for Eldorado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/eldorado/scrape
Accept: application/json

### 15. Get System Configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/config
Accept: application/json

### 16. Check Background Scraper Worker Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/scraper/status
Accept: application/json

### ============================================================
### LEGACY ENDPOINTS COMPATIBILITY TEST
### ============================================================

### Legacy Exchange Rate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/exchange_rate
Accept: application/json

### Legacy Snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/snapshot?platform=g2g
Accept: application/json

### Legacy Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/items?platform=g2g
Accept: application/json
